---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About & Philosophy | Rishika Miranda" 
  description="The design philosophy and journey of Rishika Miranda, founder of Kyrah Design Studio."
>
  
  <!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
  <section class="px-8 md:px-16 pt-20 pb-12 md:pt-32 md:pb-16 w-full">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <span class="step-line w-12 mb-8"></span>
      <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-muted mb-6 font-bold">
        Architect, Interior Designer & Studio Founder
      </p>
      
      <h1 class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl leading-none font-medium text-ink">
        The space behind<br/>
        <em>the stories.</em>
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BIOGRAPHY NARRATIVE CORE -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 py-12 md:py-16 w-full">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-start">
      
      <!-- Primary Storytelling Spine -->
      <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed font-mono">
        <p>
          I’m the founder of <a href="https://kyrah.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-orange font-medium border-b border-orange/40 pb-0.5 hover:text-ink hover:border-ink transition-colors duration-300">Kyrah Design Studio</a>, a Bangalore-based interior design practice focused on creating thoughtfully crafted residential spaces.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          Over the past five years, I’ve had the opportunity to build Kyrah from the ground up—shaping not just the physical homes we design, but also the way we approach collaboration, deep material craftsmanship, and site execution.
        </p>

        <p>
          My work sits squarely at the intersection of design vision and real-world implementation. While great spaces often begin as ethereal ideas and sketches, bringing them to life requires meticulous coordination with clients, master craftsmen, contractors, and specialized vendors.
        </p>

        <p>
          Being deeply involved on-site has fundamentally shaped how I think about design—as something that must be both visually inspiring and inherently buildable.
        </p>

        <p>
          At Kyrah, we work closely with homeowners to create spaces that feel personal, layered, and timeless. Many of our projects draw intentionally from traditional Indian craftsmanship and material richness while being sensitively adapted for contemporary living.
        </p>

        <p>
          As a studio founder, I’m equally passionate about building a strong, curious team culture where open collaboration, shared curiosity, and active problem-solving are part of the everyday creative process. Five years into this journey, what continues to excite me most is the endless opportunity to keep learning—from projects, from people on site, and from the evolving world of design.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Structural Sidebar Asymmetry -->
      <div class="hidden md:block md:col-span-4 border-l border-warm pl-8 py-2">
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted uppercase tracking-widest font-mono font-bold mb-3">Core Focus</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-mono text-stone-600">
          <li>&bull; Residential Frameworks</li>
          <li>&bull; Material Adaptations</li>
          <li>&bull; Artisanal Collaboration</li>
          <li>&bull; Architectural Detail</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- COLLABORATION GRID - Simplified 4-Cell Matrix -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 py-16 md:py-24 w-full">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="step-line w-8 mb-6"></span>
      <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-muted font-bold mb-2">Engagements</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium italic text-ink">Ways to Collaborate</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-warm border border-warm">
      
      <!-- 1. Hire the Studio -->
      <div class="bg-paper p-8 group transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/50">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <span class="step-line w-10 group-hover:w-16 transition-all duration-300"></span>
          <span class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-muted font-bold">01</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-medium text-ink mb-4">Hire the Studio</h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted mb-6">Available for full‑service architecture, residential master planning, and premium custom interior studio projects.</p>
        <a href="mailto:hello@kyrah.in?subject=Project%20Inquiry%20-%20Kyrah%20Studio" class="text-[11px] tracking-wider uppercase font-mono font-bold text-orange hover:text-ink transition-colors">
          hello@kyrah.in &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <!-- 2. Creative Collaborations (Personal) -->
      <div class="bg-paper p-8 group transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/50">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <span class="step-line w-10 group-hover:w-16 transition-all duration-300"></span>
          <span class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-muted font-bold">02</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-medium text-ink mb-4">Creative Collaborations</h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted mb-6">Partnering with independent artists, design houses, creative consulting requests, or curated physical experiences on a personal level.</p>
        <a href="mailto:rishikamiranda@gmail.com?subject=Collaboration%20Inquiry" class="text-[11px] tracking-wider uppercase font-mono font-bold text-orange hover:text-ink transition-colors">
          rishikamiranda@gmail.com &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <!-- 3. Resources (Combined 3 & 4) -->
      <div class="bg-paper p-8 group transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/50">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <span class="step-line w-10 group-hover:w-16 transition-all duration-300"></span>
          <span class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-muted font-bold">03</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-medium text-ink mb-4">Resources</h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted mb-6">Interior architectural blueprints, technical documentation checklists, mood boards, and open-source knowledge frameworks.</p>
        <span class="text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase font-mono text-muted italic">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Shop (Process Broadcast Shift) -->
      <div class="bg-paper p-8 group transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/50">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <span class="step-line w-10 group-hover:w-16 transition-all duration-300"></span>
          <span class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-muted font-bold">04</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-medium text-ink mb-4">Shop</h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted mb-6">A curated collection of intentionally designed furniture items, fun functional objects, graphics, and custom studio artifacts.</p>
        <span class="text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase font-mono text-muted italic">Coming soon</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- METADATA TIMELINE SECTIONS -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 py-12 md:py-20 w-full border-t border-warm/60">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Recognition (Simplified Title) -->
      <div>
        <div class="mb-8">
          <span class="step-line w-6 mb-4"></span>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted font-mono">Recognition</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs text-ink leading-relaxed">
          <li class="border-b border-warm/40 pb-3">
            <span class="block font-bold text-stone-500">Awards Tier</span>
            National Architecture and Interior Design Awards citation.
            <a href="https://kyrah.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-orange inline-block ml-1 hover:underline">Artifact View &rarr;</a>
          </li>
          <li class="border-b border-warm/40 pb-3">
            <span class="block font-bold text-stone-500">Press Feature</span>
            Business Connect India — Architectural Profile focus feature.
          </li>
          <li class="border-b border-warm/40 pb-3">
            <span class="block font-bold text-stone-500">Public Speaking</span>
            Kanara Entrepreneurs Bangalore Members Meet panel outline.
          </li>
          <li class="border-b border-warm/40 pb-3">
            <span class="block font-bold text-stone-500">Symposium</span>
            KE Konnect Summit citation review coverage index.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Education & Socials -->
      <div class="space-y-12">
        
        <!-- Education Section (Simplified Title) -->
        <div>
          <div class="mb-8">
            <span class="step-line w-6 mb-4"></span>
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted font-mono">Education</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline gap-4 font-mono border-b border-warm/40 pb-3">
            <div>
              <span class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink">Ramaiah Institute of Technology</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-muted">Bachelor of Architecture (B.Arch)</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-stone-400">Bangalore</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Socials Section (Simplified Title) -->
        <div>
          <div class="mb-6">
            <span class="step-line w-6 mb-4"></span>
            <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted font-mono">Socials</h2>
          </div>
          <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-mono font-bold">
            <li>
              <a href="https://kyrah.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-orange transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
                Studio &rarr; <span class="text-stone-400 font-normal font-sans">kyrah.in</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rishika-miranda-163260329/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-orange transition-colors">
                LinkedIn &rarr;
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.instagram.com/rishikamiranda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-orange transition-colors">
                Instagram &rarr;
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://in.pinterest.com/rishikamiranda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stone-600 hover:text-orange transition-colors">
                Pinterest &rarr;
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>